# Input

```scss
@container   #{$name}   (min-width:400px) {
  .a { display: block; }
}

@container #{$query}{
  .a { display: block; }
}

@CONTAINER sidebar-#{$name}   (min-width: 400px) {}

@container #{$name}-sidebar (width>400px)   and   (height > 200px) {}

@container #{$name} not   (width > 400px) {}

@container #{$name} style(--responsive:true) {}

@container #{ $query }   and (min-width: 400px) {}

@container (min-width: 400px) or   #{$query} {}

@container not    #{$query} {}

@container #{$a} #{$b} {}

```


